  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"7a\"><p><strong>7a</strong></p><p></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T = \\frac{60}{17} \\approx 3.529\"></span> s <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\approx 3.53\"></span> s</p>\n<p>Calculated answer must be given to at least 4 significant figures in order to earn the mark.</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"7b\"><p><strong>7b</strong></p><p></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.53 = 2 \\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{0.78}{g}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g \\approx 2.5\"></span> N kg<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> or m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"7c\"><p><strong>7c</strong></p><p> </p>\n<p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure>\n</p>\n<p> </p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"7d\"><p><strong>7d</strong></p><p> </p>\n<p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_03\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 3\" src=\"asset:fig_03\"/></figure>\n</p>\n<p> </p></section>"
